From b545caff1c25f5d2c901663806fa863c5112e676 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode <opencode@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:46:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] native: plan, NativeAdreno device client, PM4 builder
 and N0 probe

Adds docs/native-adreno-driver.md and userspace/native/: a Vulkan-free
client for the kernel's NativeAdreno ABI 1 (IOAcceleratorES + NTNL
tunnel), a checked PM4 builder, a host test, and a one-shot probe that
runs inside backboardd and has the GPU write two words through
CP_MEM_WRITE before reading them back after the real CP fence.

The probe is gated by /var/local/mtl2-native-probe or SWEET_NATIVE_PROBE=1
and closes the user client before Turnip opens it, so an installed bundle
behaves exactly as before unless asked. metal2.yml runs the host test.

